Fingerprint stage C part 1 (negronifp=3): the Goodix MCU message layer over the stage-A GENI SPI
(public protocol of the Goodix MCU sensors, goodix-fp-dump goodix.py: message pack A0 len16 sum8 +
message protocol cmd len16 payload 0xAA-sum8; the 5120-SPI transport prefix CC F2 seq16 / BB F1 00 00
as a second variant), bounded chunked RX, IRQ-pin watch after each frame, decode of the answer. Step 10
sends query-MCU-state (AE 55), firmware version (A8 00 00), read OTP (A6 00 00), nop and
read-sensor-register 0 and logs the raw bytes: "VALID message pack" = the G7 MCU speaks the public
protocol; "MISO idle" = it does not (the real protocol is in the TEE application). Also fixes two 0350
items from docs/audit/2026-10-26-peripherals.md: the ldoc11 vote retries EBUSY 40 x 50 ms (as 0330) and
the thread stops when the vote fails. Boot-args negronifp_wrap, negronifp_irqwait. Applies after 0350.
Details: docs/fingerprint-plan.md section 7, patches/xnu/README-fingerprint.md.

